  "details": "We can now search and copy youtube links inside VR (using SteamVR Desktop Tab), but not possible to paste it into VRC video player from VR. Everytime when I need to paste a link, I have to put down my VR, walk to my PC and click the input box from Desktop.\nIf there is a \"Paste from clipboard\"  button for video player then I can copy and paste links without taking off my Headset, which will be super convenient.\nThanks",
